{
  "$comment": [
    "Default CSS schema packs for the Layer-2 crawler (scripts/scrapers/outlist_crawler.py).",
    "Used ONLY when a scraping_sources row has no event_container selector: this kills the",
    "'no event_container selector' skip backlog (9/14 sources in the 2026-06-21 dry run)",
    "without waiting for admin-panel selector entry.",
    "Match order: first pack whose 'name' substring (case-insensitive) matches source",
    "name/site_name, OR whose 'url' substring matches the source URL. Substrings are",
    "chosen long enough to avoid false positives.",
    "These selectors are consumed by JsonCssExtractionStrategy (baseSelector + fields).",
    "The crawler always falls back to JSON-LD first and to the 9-candidate heuristic",
    "discovery, so a wrong selector here degrades to old behavior, never worse.",
    "Live tuning happens at rollout-wave gates (see plan section 5/6).",
    "Rollout order: OCCII (pilot, wave 0), Melkweg + Paradiso (wave 1), Partyflock + RA (wave 2), rest (wave 3).",
    "Round 2: EVERY registered scraping_sources row now has a pack (round-2 hard",
    "requirement: per-source external LINK + raw_time_string + images). The only",
    "registered row without a pack is the internal pseudo-source 'webhook'",
    "(url internal://scraping-webhook) — it is an intake endpoint, not a crawl",
    "target. The edge_function-method student-org packs are reference/fallback:",
    "their primary runner stays the edge fn, but the packs become live if the",
    "method is ever flipped to html_scrape. Every pack carries explicit 'link'",
    "and 'time' keys; the crawler hardens all three signals on every candidate",
    "regardless (probe_link / probe_image / probe_time_text)."
  ],
  "packs": [
    {
      "match": {
        "name": [
          "occii"
        ],
        "url": [
          "occii.org"
        ]
      },
      "selectors": {
        "event_container": ".event, article",
        "title": "h2, h3, .event-title",
        "date": "time, .event-date",
        "time": "time, .event-time",
        "location": ".location, .venue",
        "image": "img",
        "link": "a",
        "description": ".description, .event-description"
      }
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "name": [
          "melkweg"
        ],
        "url": [
          "melkweg.nl"
        ]
      },
      "selectors": {
        "event_container": "article, .c-event, .event-list-item",
        "title": "h2, h3, .c-event__title",
        "date": "time, .c-event__date",
        "time": "time, .event-time",
        "location": ".c-event__room, .venue",
        "image": "img",
        "link": "a",
        "description": ".c-event__description, .description"
      },
      "list_parser": "day_grouped",
      "detail_times": true
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "name": [
          "paradiso"
        ],
        "url": [
          "paradiso.nl"
        ]
      },
      "selectors": {
        "event_container": "article, .event-card, .event-item",
        "title": "h2, h3, .event-card__title",
        "date": "time, .event-card__date",
        "time": "time, .event-time",
        "location": ".event-card__hall, .venue",
        "image": "img",
        "link": "a",
        "description": ".event-card__description, .description"
      },
      "fetch_url": "https://www.paradiso.nl/en/program",
      "list_parser": "paradiso_by_date"
    },
    {
      "match": {
        "name": [
          "partyflock"
        ],
        "url": [
          "partyflock.nl"
        ]
      },
      "selectors": {
